<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Culturecom shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Culturecom shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of publisher Culturecom Holdings Ltd was suspended at the direction of the stock exchange pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The company shares ended HK$0.005 down at HK$0.28 on Tuesday with 1.94 million shares changed hand.</p>
<p>Culturecom publishes comic books and newspapers.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
